      "output": "SPEC.md has been created at the project root. Here's a summary of what it covers:\n\n**Key decisions:**\n- **Zero new UI components** — fully reuses existing `Hero`, `MissionStrip`, `FeaturesGrid`/`FeatureCard`, `CtaBanner`, and `SectionWrapper` from `@space-tourism/ui`\n- **Lazy-loaded** via `React.lazy()` matching the existing LandingPage/ContactPage pattern (0 KB initial bundle impact)\n- **Static content** extracted to `apps/web/src/constants/aboutContent.ts` for clean separation\n- **No state management needed** — fully static page, only React Router navigation\n\n**Files to be created/modified:**\n- `apps/web/src/pages/AboutPage.tsx` (new page component)\n- `apps/web/src/constants/aboutContent.ts` (new content constants)\n- `apps/web/src/App.tsx` (add route)\n- `e2e/e2e/about.spec.ts` (new E2E tests)\n\n**4 ADRs** documented: component reuse, lazy loading, static content separation, and E2E test patterns.\n\n**6 open questions** flagged for Content/Product/Design owners regarding actual copy, values, and hero treatment.",
